WEBVTT

01:30.800 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:38.640 --> 01:40.640
Because you're from the Spirit Clan,

01:40.720 --> 01:42.640
if you're willing to hand over the token,

01:43.280 --> 01:45.680
I can keep your whereabouts secret.

01:45.760 --> 01:47.800
It seems the token isn't with you.

01:47.880 --> 01:49.120
Since she's here,

01:49.760 --> 01:51.880
the token must be hidden somewhere else.

02:07.200 --> 02:09.120
Didn't you say you wouldn't help me,

02:09.639 --> 02:10.759
and my life or death was up to me?

02:12.680 --> 02:13.800
It's just an act.

02:14.480 --> 02:15.640
There's no need for anyone to really die.

02:16.240 --> 02:18.240
Can't you say something nice for once?

02:22.120 --> 02:23.480
After such a big show,

02:24.080 --> 02:25.360
purposely letting her go,

02:26.320 --> 02:28.120
do you really think
she'll go find her accomplices?

02:28.760 --> 02:30.000
She's made up her mind to die.

02:30.800 --> 02:32.400
We won't get anything from forcing her.

02:33.640 --> 02:35.360
Now that she knows
her identity's been exposed,

02:36.200 --> 02:38.000
she can't leave the city,
and she can't treat her wounds.

02:38.080 --> 02:40.600
She'll have to go find
her hidden accomplices

02:40.680 --> 02:42.480
and look for another chance
to get the token out.

02:44.000 --> 02:45.640
How are you sure she has accomplices?

02:46.920 --> 02:49.120
The location of the token is a top secret,

02:49.720 --> 02:51.720
and there are layers of defenses
inside and outside the Mirage Palace.

02:52.480 --> 02:54.160
It's impossible for it
to be stolen so easily.

02:56.520 --> 02:58.880
If Su Ningzhen weren't the real thief,

02:59.640 --> 03:01.040
then there's only one possibility.

03:01.560 --> 03:03.080
Inside the Mirage Palace,

03:03.160 --> 03:05.200
someone is working
with this Serpent Spirit.

03:06.000 --> 03:07.240
Do you suspect anyone?

03:09.240 --> 03:10.240
For now,

03:11.200 --> 03:13.240
we can only see if Xuyue
can catch up with them.

03:39.520 --> 03:41.960
You must find a chance
to take this token out.

03:44.480 --> 03:45.960
My wound might never heal.

03:46.520 --> 03:48.280
You must help the Master
complete the great task.

03:48.880 --> 03:50.680
This is not just the Master's wish,

03:51.440 --> 03:52.920
It's the hope of our entire Spirit Clan.

03:58.560 --> 03:59.640
You go first.

04:04.680 --> 04:05.600
What are you planning to do?

04:06.360 --> 04:07.600
Are you going to take me
to the Mirage Palace

04:07.680 --> 04:09.120
or the Spirit Management Bureau?

04:09.640 --> 04:11.840
Are you going to threaten
and bribe me or torture me?

04:16.680 --> 04:18.040
I won't let you have your way.

04:33.160 --> 04:35.080
I failed. The Serpent Spirit is dead.

04:35.160 --> 04:36.640
Her accomplice has also escaped.

04:37.400 --> 04:38.840
All I brought back was
the Serpent Spirit's spiritual essence.

04:40.800 --> 04:41.800
You did a good job.

04:41.880 --> 04:43.320
At least you confirmed for us

04:43.400 --> 04:44.440
that she has companions.

04:47.240 --> 04:48.640
What did they say when they met?

04:48.720 --> 04:49.640
The Serpent Spirit told her accomplice

04:49.720 --> 04:51.600
to take the token away.

04:51.680 --> 04:53.120
She also mentioned their master,

04:53.640 --> 04:54.840
saying it was

04:55.440 --> 04:56.560
for the entire Spirit Clan.

04:58.720 --> 05:00.200
Why are you staring at me?

05:00.280 --> 05:01.600
I don't know anything.

05:05.160 --> 05:06.280
Master?

05:11.320 --> 05:12.880
Have you ever heard

05:12.960 --> 05:14.080
of the Decaying Immortal Pavilion?

05:20.920 --> 05:22.160
It's a mysterious organization

05:22.240 --> 05:23.520
that has emerged
in the human world in recent years.

05:24.120 --> 05:25.640
They act secretly,

05:25.720 --> 05:27.520
and their members' identities are unknown.

05:28.120 --> 05:30.360
No one has ever truly found their traces.

05:30.960 --> 05:32.440
But over time,

05:32.520 --> 05:34.040
some information is bound to leak out.

05:34.840 --> 05:37.080
I've heard that to join
the Decaying Immortal Pavilion,

05:37.160 --> 05:38.480
one must brand a special mark

05:38.560 --> 05:40.320
and swear eternal loyalty.

05:40.400 --> 05:41.920
For the Humans,

05:42.000 --> 05:43.480
it's branded
on the spirit platform inside the body,

05:44.160 --> 05:45.320
while for the Spirit Clan,

05:46.600 --> 05:47.800
it's branded on the spiritual essence.

05:51.680 --> 05:53.160
The Decaying Immortal Pavilion…

05:53.240 --> 05:54.560
This name sounds

05:54.640 --> 05:56.120
like it has a conflict
with the Immortal Alliance.

05:57.000 --> 05:59.720
So, the Decaying Immortal Pavilion
has been lying low for years,

05:59.800 --> 06:01.800
waiting to join forces with
the Dark Clan to seize the Chaos Pearl.

06:04.520 --> 06:06.320
Do you think
the Decaying Immortal Pavilion

06:06.400 --> 06:08.200
is the same group
as the traitor in the Immortal Alliance

06:08.280 --> 06:09.440
who sold you out?

06:09.520 --> 06:11.480
According to what the Serpent Spirit said,

06:11.560 --> 06:13.680
the reason they are doing these things

06:13.760 --> 06:16.440
is also because of the conflict
between Humans and the Spirit Clan.

06:16.520 --> 06:18.360
If this issue isn't resolved properly,

06:18.440 --> 06:20.520
I'm afraid things
won't be peaceful in the future.

06:29.920 --> 06:31.800
For now, let's wait
for news from Miss Gao.

06:32.600 --> 06:35.400
First, we need to retrieve the token,
then plan our next move.

06:37.480 --> 06:38.720
No matter what,

06:39.560 --> 06:41.200
the Chaos Pearl must not be compromised.

06:44.600 --> 06:46.960
MIRAGE PALACE

06:51.400 --> 06:52.480
-What's going on?
-What's your name?

06:52.560 --> 06:53.880
-I don't know.
-Wang Zheng.

06:59.320 --> 07:00.800
-Search this place thoroughly!
-Yes!

07:00.880 --> 07:01.720
-Search!
-Yes!

07:01.800 --> 07:02.880
Yes!

07:04.080 --> 07:05.600
-You, go over there.
-Yes!

07:05.680 --> 07:07.040
-Where's the Serpent Spirit?
-Search here.

07:07.120 --> 07:08.480
-Be careful.
-Understood.

07:08.560 --> 07:09.560
She ran away.

07:09.640 --> 07:10.560
She ran away?

07:11.080 --> 07:12.720
With you there,
the Serpent Spirit could escape?

07:15.360 --> 07:17.160
I was heavily injured in the Dark Abyss.

07:17.240 --> 07:18.200
My spiritual power was greatly weakened.

07:19.040 --> 07:20.520
If it weren't for Miss Mu's help,

07:21.680 --> 07:22.520
I'm afraid…

07:23.720 --> 07:25.400
I would have died
by that Serpent Spirit's hands.

07:27.800 --> 07:28.920
That's… right!

07:29.000 --> 07:30.480
It was quite dangerous just now.

07:30.560 --> 07:31.840
Fortunately, I was there.

07:33.720 --> 07:34.960
Had I known you two were like this,

07:35.040 --> 07:36.160
I wouldn't have let you investigate.

07:37.120 --> 07:38.600
Right now, there is indeed something

07:39.160 --> 07:40.320
that you need to look into.

07:42.600 --> 07:43.520
What is it?

07:44.680 --> 07:46.000
MIRAGE PALACE DISCIPLE ROSTER

07:48.600 --> 07:49.440
GONGSUN QIN

07:49.520 --> 07:51.000
Gongsun Qin.

07:53.080 --> 07:54.080
Come over.

07:54.160 --> 07:55.120
Come.

07:55.640 --> 07:57.880
We've already checked hundreds of people.

07:57.960 --> 07:59.200
How many are left?

08:00.640 --> 08:02.040
Only about 20.

08:05.720 --> 08:06.800
Alright.

08:08.240 --> 08:09.280
Next!

08:11.560 --> 08:13.560
I'm… He Qun…

08:13.640 --> 08:15.640
No issues… the night before last…

08:15.720 --> 08:17.760
I… went to bed early…

08:17.840 --> 08:18.960
No one can testify for me…

08:20.680 --> 08:21.560
Gotcha!

08:21.640 --> 08:23.800
No… it's not me!

08:24.400 --> 08:25.680
If it's not you, why are you so nervous?

08:25.760 --> 08:27.160
Your words are all confused.

08:27.240 --> 08:31.320
I… I have a stutter.

08:31.840 --> 08:34.159
The entire palace… can prove it.

08:35.159 --> 08:37.280
But no one can prove
where you were the night before last.

08:37.360 --> 08:38.440
I…

08:48.320 --> 08:51.800
Did you sleep with him
the night before last?

08:51.880 --> 08:53.560
I… I'm his sister.

08:53.640 --> 08:56.520
I received a letter
from home two days ago,

08:56.600 --> 08:57.960
saying our mother was gravely ill.

08:58.480 --> 09:01.240
So, I went to discuss this
with my brother.

09:03.400 --> 09:04.920
Then, what about last night?

09:05.000 --> 09:06.200
What did you two do last night?

09:06.800 --> 09:08.800
I went to the kitchen to steal something,

09:08.880 --> 09:11.160
planning to send it back home.
But I was caught

09:12.240 --> 09:13.520
and was punished to wash dishes all night.

09:18.520 --> 09:20.120
Alright, you can go now.

09:20.760 --> 09:22.960
-Understood.
-He's not the person.

09:25.680 --> 09:26.840
Next!

09:27.760 --> 09:28.800
-Not the person.
-Next!

09:29.560 --> 09:30.640
-Not the person.
-I was punished to clean the front yard.

09:31.240 --> 09:32.480
Next!

09:33.600 --> 09:36.080
-Next…
-Senior can testify for me…

09:41.320 --> 09:42.320
Madam.

09:42.400 --> 09:44.880
How's Xie Xuechen's progress?

09:44.960 --> 09:46.920
There were some actions
in the Warmth Pavilion.

09:47.000 --> 09:48.880
The Serpent Spirit
who stole the token is dead,

09:48.960 --> 09:50.200
but we didn't find the token.

09:51.600 --> 09:53.000
Keep watching.

09:53.520 --> 09:54.560
Understood.

09:55.080 --> 09:56.480
What about Qiumin?

09:57.200 --> 09:59.160
She has summoned
all the disciples in the palace

09:59.240 --> 10:00.360
and is questioning them one by one

10:00.440 --> 10:02.080
about their whereabouts
from the night before last to today.

10:03.760 --> 10:05.120
She suspects

10:05.200 --> 10:06.960
there's a mole inside the palace.

10:07.640 --> 10:09.400
Yes. However,

10:09.480 --> 10:11.200
there are too many
disciples in the palace.

10:11.280 --> 10:12.480
She's making quite a stir.

10:12.560 --> 10:15.000
Should I stop her?

10:15.080 --> 10:16.480
No need.

10:16.560 --> 10:17.600
Let her investigate.

10:18.800 --> 10:21.160
The Mirage Palace
hasn't been cleaned for too long.

10:21.920 --> 10:24.160
It's a good opportunity to clean it up.

10:25.440 --> 10:26.760
Go tell Qiumin

10:27.360 --> 10:30.000
to search every room

10:30.600 --> 10:32.600
to see where the token really is.

10:36.080 --> 10:37.320
Do we have to search every room?

10:38.400 --> 10:41.480
Won't this make
the disciples uncomfortable?

10:41.560 --> 10:42.960
Uncomfortable?

10:44.440 --> 10:45.960
I'm not just searching rooms,

10:47.120 --> 10:49.080
I'm going to search everyone's bodies.

10:50.880 --> 10:53.240
Do they dare to be uncomfortable?

10:54.920 --> 10:56.200
Of course not.

10:56.280 --> 10:57.800
I'll go deliver the message right away.

10:59.720 --> 11:00.560
Zai Xi.

11:04.400 --> 11:05.520
Madam.

11:07.960 --> 11:10.200
What have you been doing

11:10.280 --> 11:11.480
from the night before last to today?

11:14.280 --> 11:15.640
Are you suspecting me, Madam?

11:19.720 --> 11:20.760
How could that be?

11:22.240 --> 11:23.160
I'm just asking casually.

11:26.960 --> 11:29.440
I was formulating medicine the other day,
but encountered some difficulties.

11:29.520 --> 11:31.560
So, I went to the library
at night to consult the texts

11:32.080 --> 11:34.120
until midnight,
when I heard the palace alarm go off

11:34.200 --> 11:36.520
and realized
the Spirit Clan had stolen the token.

11:36.600 --> 11:38.800
By the time I got there,
you had already injured her.

11:38.880 --> 11:40.600
The Spirit Clan had already fled.

11:40.680 --> 11:41.880
From yesterday to today,

11:41.960 --> 11:43.560
I've been refining medicine
in the alchemy room.

11:43.640 --> 11:45.520
I only came out an hour ago

11:45.600 --> 11:47.160
and heard about the Young Madam's actions.

11:47.680 --> 11:50.840
The disciples guarding the library
and alchemy room can confirm this.

12:01.760 --> 12:03.880
I see. Go ahead.

12:39.160 --> 12:40.320
What are you looking at?

12:42.200 --> 12:43.440
Your people?

12:45.240 --> 12:46.280
What are you here for?

12:47.400 --> 12:48.880
It's windy here.

12:48.960 --> 12:51.080
I bring you some medicine
to keep away the cold.

12:51.160 --> 12:52.480
I don't drink wine.

12:56.640 --> 12:57.600
Then, I'll drink it myself.

13:03.600 --> 13:04.760
This wine is quite good.

13:10.880 --> 13:12.320
When I was in the Dark Abyss,

13:13.000 --> 13:14.000
we never saw the light of day.

13:14.600 --> 13:15.680
Though there were flowers and plants,

13:16.520 --> 13:18.400
they were all soaked
in demonic energy all day long.

13:19.160 --> 13:20.960
The wine brewed from them

13:21.040 --> 13:22.160
also carried poison.

13:23.680 --> 13:27.280
We often drank poisoned wine
with antidote.

13:28.440 --> 13:30.280
Knowing the danger,

13:30.360 --> 13:32.880
but still unable to resist
the desire in our hearts,

13:33.400 --> 13:34.600
we rushed towards it eagerly.

13:35.200 --> 13:36.720
Now it's fine.

13:36.800 --> 13:38.280
I can drink as I please.

13:43.400 --> 13:46.400
I heard the tallest building ahead
is the Spirit Management Bureau,

13:46.920 --> 13:49.080
the nightmare place
for countless Spirit Clan members.

13:50.040 --> 13:51.840
If it weren't for the Spirit
Management Bureau, this hellish place,

13:53.040 --> 13:55.560
if the lord of the Mirage City
isn't Su Ningzhen,

13:56.160 --> 13:57.360
this place actually

13:58.160 --> 14:00.240
looks like a human paradise.

14:03.800 --> 14:05.960
Why did you lie to Gao Qiumin today,

14:06.040 --> 14:07.720
saying you couldn't defeat
that Serpent Spirit?

14:09.680 --> 14:10.960
I wasn't lying to her.

14:11.560 --> 14:13.000
You were lying to Su Ningzhen?

14:16.200 --> 14:17.160
No…

14:18.600 --> 14:19.880
Not just Su Ningzhen,

14:22.360 --> 14:23.880
but the entire Immortal Alliance.

14:24.840 --> 14:26.320
I don't know who the mole is.

14:27.160 --> 14:28.840
I have to keep it from everyone for now.

14:30.040 --> 14:31.280
Only if I show weakness

14:31.960 --> 14:33.800
will the enemy think
there's an opportunity.

14:37.880 --> 14:40.160
Oh, our Mr. Xie

14:40.240 --> 14:41.560
has learned to deceive.

14:42.920 --> 14:43.960
What's this?

14:46.520 --> 14:47.680
Those close to the dark are tainted.

14:49.240 --> 14:50.760
Fine!

14:50.840 --> 14:52.840
I've misled you.

14:55.560 --> 14:58.520
But what if they believe it's true

14:59.240 --> 15:00.240
and come to kill you?

15:01.560 --> 15:02.600
Then, let them come.

15:10.560 --> 15:12.400
So, our Mr. Xie

15:12.480 --> 15:13.840
is really that self-confident.

15:13.920 --> 15:15.480
But I guess,

15:16.080 --> 15:18.120
in the face of absolute power,

15:18.200 --> 15:20.320
all schemes are useless.

15:24.200 --> 15:25.560
Is there so much to write down?

15:27.320 --> 15:29.360
Maybe you're just used to yourself,

15:31.200 --> 15:33.280
but in my eyes, you're still quite fresh.

15:35.320 --> 15:36.240
What's wrong?

15:36.880 --> 15:38.800
Are you curious about how I wrote you?

15:38.880 --> 15:39.880
Want to see?

15:39.960 --> 15:41.000
Not curious at all.

15:47.000 --> 15:48.440
He's quite arrogant.

15:48.520 --> 15:50.360
HE'S PRETTY SELF-CONFIDENT
AND HE'S QUITE ARROGANT

16:02.000 --> 16:04.720
Today is the ninth of the month.
Sir, it's time for your medicine.

16:06.080 --> 16:08.040
Alright, I'll take it soon.

16:31.080 --> 16:33.840
Greenview Heights has been
out of the Immortal Alliance for years.

16:33.920 --> 16:36.880
You have never been interested
in the matters of the Immortal Alliance.

16:36.960 --> 16:38.800
Why are you getting involved this time?

16:39.480 --> 16:42.120
Is it for Xie Xuechen or…

16:43.320 --> 16:44.160
for that old friend?

16:48.360 --> 16:49.760
Rather than saying it's for someone,

16:50.440 --> 16:52.320
it's more like it's for myself.

16:52.400 --> 16:53.440
I wanted something interesting.

16:54.360 --> 16:56.320
I've been bored for so many years.

16:56.400 --> 16:58.040
Finally, someone interesting appeared,

16:58.680 --> 17:00.640
and some interesting things are happening.

17:01.360 --> 17:02.560
I also want to see

17:02.640 --> 17:05.680
how this story ends up.

17:10.000 --> 17:10.960
By the way,

17:12.000 --> 17:13.880
had the token already
been stolen the night before last

17:14.480 --> 17:16.520
when you escorted someone
back to the Mirage Palace?

17:17.560 --> 17:19.960
-Yes.
-Then, when you saw Su Ningzhen,

17:20.480 --> 17:21.760
did you notice anything strange?

17:24.480 --> 17:27.359
At that time, the Mirage Palace
was busy with the search.

17:27.440 --> 17:28.760
I also asked Su Ningzhen a few questions,

17:29.440 --> 17:31.560
got the general idea of things, and left.

17:31.640 --> 17:33.160
I didn't notice anything unusual.

17:33.800 --> 17:35.560
Sir, are you suspecting Su Ningzhen?

17:39.720 --> 17:41.400
We came here to investigate.

17:41.480 --> 17:42.960
There was quite a stir,

17:43.040 --> 17:44.800
both openly and secretly.

17:46.400 --> 17:48.080
But she didn't stop us at all.

17:49.440 --> 17:50.680
That doesn't seem like her style.

17:52.800 --> 17:55.080
When I looked at Madam Su's expression,

17:55.160 --> 17:57.800
that kind of anger
didn't seem like an act.

18:00.480 --> 18:02.000
Speaking of something unusual,

18:02.720 --> 18:05.960
it seems there's really something off.

18:09.600 --> 18:12.200
CELESTIAL INN

18:12.280 --> 18:14.880
I've inquired about every person
in the Mirage Palace

18:14.960 --> 18:16.520
and verified it all.

18:16.600 --> 18:18.800
I haven't found anyone suspicious.

18:18.880 --> 18:21.080
And I've carefully searched everyone,

18:21.160 --> 18:23.680
checked their rooms,
and didn't find the token.

18:23.760 --> 18:25.880
Xie Xuechen, are you sure
you didn't make a mistake?

18:25.960 --> 18:27.360
There's no mole in the Mirage Palace.

18:27.440 --> 18:29.280
Are you sure

18:29.920 --> 18:30.760
you've checked everyone in the palace?

18:32.320 --> 18:35.600
I'm sure I've carefully checked
every single person.

18:36.200 --> 18:37.600
I even checked Elder Zai Xi.

18:39.240 --> 18:40.080
Except for my madam.

18:40.160 --> 18:41.920
My madam couldn't possibly be the one.

18:43.200 --> 18:44.320
There's one more person.

18:45.120 --> 18:45.960
Have you checked her?

18:46.720 --> 18:48.000
Who else?

18:49.520 --> 18:50.440
Cui Wanwan.

18:54.160 --> 18:55.720
That night when I escorted Cui Wanwan

18:55.800 --> 18:56.760
back to the Mirage Palace,

18:56.840 --> 18:58.480
I paid a visit to Madam Su.

18:58.560 --> 19:01.360
When I left, I saw a patch
of green hooked leaf outside the hall.

19:01.960 --> 19:03.880
I don't know much about plants,

19:03.960 --> 19:05.440
but I remembered it

19:05.520 --> 19:08.240
because the hooked leaf
looked quite unusual.

19:11.280 --> 19:14.000
Also, I didn't see
any hooked-leaf trees nearby.

19:14.080 --> 19:15.960
I was curious where it came from,

19:16.040 --> 19:17.440
but that thought was fleeting.

19:18.040 --> 19:19.320
At the time, I didn't
pay much attention to it.

19:19.920 --> 19:21.040
So what?

19:23.440 --> 19:25.800
Miss Gao, you grew up in the Mirage City,

19:25.880 --> 19:27.440
familiar with
spiritual flowers and plants.

19:27.520 --> 19:29.320
You should know better than us

19:29.400 --> 19:30.360
that the Mirage City

19:31.040 --> 19:32.400
doesn't have hooked-leaf trees.

19:32.480 --> 19:34.760
So, it must have come
from outside the city.

19:34.840 --> 19:37.280
The hooked-leaf plant
has many backward hooks.

19:37.360 --> 19:38.880
It's easy for it to get caught
on someone's clothing.

19:39.480 --> 19:41.640
Before it's picked, the leaf is green.

19:41.720 --> 19:44.960
Once picked,
it turns brown within one hour.

19:45.560 --> 19:47.000
Feng Yao just said

19:47.080 --> 19:48.160
the hooked leaf was green.

19:49.360 --> 19:51.200
This only proves

19:52.520 --> 19:54.080
that someone
rushed into the city that night.

19:56.880 --> 19:58.400
Even if there was that leaf,

19:58.480 --> 19:59.840
it might have been left
by the Serpent Spirit.

19:59.920 --> 20:01.160
We've checked.

20:02.360 --> 20:04.120
The Serpent Spirit
entered the city four days ago.

20:04.880 --> 20:06.080
If it was her,

20:06.960 --> 20:08.080
the leaf would have already changed color.

20:08.160 --> 20:10.480
The token's hiding place is well guarded.

20:11.160 --> 20:12.160
It's impossible for that Serpent Spirit

20:12.760 --> 20:14.480
to break the array on her own.

20:14.560 --> 20:17.320
So, Cui Wanwan
must have come back to assist.

20:19.480 --> 20:20.600
Miss Gao,

20:21.480 --> 20:23.560
when you were attacked outside the city,

20:24.200 --> 20:25.440
it was planned in advance.

20:26.080 --> 20:28.560
You were possessed by the Dark Clan
and went to Greenview Heights,

20:28.640 --> 20:29.720
while Cui Wanwan took the chance

20:30.440 --> 20:32.160
to sneak back into
the city and steal the token.

20:32.960 --> 20:35.680
She tried to create an alibi
and clear herself of suspicion.

20:38.360 --> 20:40.120
These are all your side's words.

20:40.200 --> 20:41.680
Where's the evidence? Where's the leaf?

20:41.760 --> 20:43.960
We already told you,
Feng Yao didn't pay attention to it,

20:44.560 --> 20:46.440
so she definitely
didn't bring the leaf back.

20:46.520 --> 20:49.080
Besides, even if she brought it back,

20:49.160 --> 20:51.120
the leaf would have changed color by now.

20:51.200 --> 20:52.400
It can't prove the timing.

20:53.520 --> 20:54.400
You don't have any evidence,

20:54.480 --> 20:56.160
and now you're just
making baseless accusations.

20:56.240 --> 20:58.760
Cui Wanwan has been
in the Mirage Palace for ten years.

20:58.840 --> 21:00.440
And everything has been fine
during these ten years.

21:00.520 --> 21:01.360
She couldn't have done this.

21:01.440 --> 21:03.560
You've personally inquired and searched

21:03.640 --> 21:05.160
and eliminated all other possibilities.

21:05.840 --> 21:07.120
So, what remains,

21:07.680 --> 21:09.240
even if hard to accept,

21:10.080 --> 21:11.120
is the truth.

21:20.800 --> 21:23.080
-It can't be her.
-What's the reason for your firm belief?

21:30.960 --> 21:31.800
I want to believe her.

21:33.240 --> 21:34.200
Want to believe?

21:34.960 --> 21:37.080
Now, it's the Mirage Palace
that lost the token.

21:37.160 --> 21:38.560
As the young madam,

21:38.640 --> 21:40.080
you aren't thinking
of retrieving the token soon

21:40.160 --> 21:41.560
to make up
for the Mirage Palace's mistake.

21:42.200 --> 21:44.960
Instead, you plan to risk the safety
of the entire Immortal Alliance and Humans

21:45.040 --> 21:46.800
to gamble on a bond of loyalty.

21:47.400 --> 21:49.200
How generous of you!

21:49.920 --> 21:51.920
Do you think we're busy here

21:52.640 --> 21:53.600
just to entertain you?

22:04.440 --> 22:06.000
Looks like Miss Mu

22:07.320 --> 22:09.600
has some ill will against Miss Gao.

22:11.680 --> 22:12.640
Yes.

22:13.920 --> 22:14.880
I don't like her.

22:15.600 --> 22:17.040
I've never liked her.

22:20.320 --> 22:24.800
ELEGANCE PAVILION

22:24.880 --> 22:25.880
Senior,

22:25.960 --> 22:26.920
you're here!

22:30.600 --> 22:32.480
How do you know it's me
before the door is even open?

22:32.560 --> 22:35.240
Because only you
knock like that every time.

22:36.520 --> 22:37.960
-What's this?
-Well,

22:38.040 --> 22:39.880
I just visited the Celestial Inn,

22:39.960 --> 22:41.880
and on my way back,
I specially brought this for you.

22:43.760 --> 22:44.720
Looks delicious!

22:45.320 --> 22:46.320
You told me before

22:46.400 --> 22:48.360
that you suffered a lot
when you were little,

22:48.440 --> 22:50.800
and when you grew up,
your favorite food became sweets.

22:52.280 --> 22:53.160
Thank you, Senior.

22:58.880 --> 23:03.200
By the way, since we didn't find anything,
did Mr. Xie and the others

23:03.280 --> 23:04.520
complain anything?

23:06.240 --> 23:08.680
They said the previous investigation
direction was wrong,

23:08.760 --> 23:10.600
so they need to rethink.

23:11.800 --> 23:13.640
It's really delicious.

23:15.880 --> 23:17.240
Wanwan,

23:17.320 --> 23:18.360
do you think

23:18.440 --> 23:21.240
the one colluding with
the Spirit Clan to steal the token

23:22.320 --> 23:24.320
is really one of our own people?

23:30.080 --> 23:32.000
What do they want?

23:32.080 --> 23:33.480
Is it something
the Mirage Palace can't provide?

23:34.080 --> 23:35.720
Why betray us?

23:35.800 --> 23:36.680
Senior,

23:36.760 --> 23:39.560
they say you can't know
a person from their face.

23:39.640 --> 23:42.600
In this world, people live
for themselves, after all.

23:42.680 --> 23:44.200
Is that true for you, too?

23:44.280 --> 23:45.720
You have something you want as well?

23:45.800 --> 23:48.600
Of course. Everyone
has something they desire, right?

23:50.120 --> 23:52.440
As for me, I don't want to suffer anymore.

23:53.040 --> 23:54.640
I just want to live like this forever,

23:56.800 --> 23:58.080
not needing to be extraordinary,

23:58.880 --> 24:01.160
just being a regular cultivator,

24:01.240 --> 24:02.760
living an ordinary life.

24:04.160 --> 24:05.280
And also,

24:05.360 --> 24:07.160
always staying by your side,

24:07.240 --> 24:10.640
watching you become the greatest
female cultivator of the Humans,

24:10.720 --> 24:13.840
and watching you stand atop the Humans!

24:24.760 --> 24:26.320
Senior…

24:29.840 --> 24:31.200
How come…

24:31.720 --> 24:34.000
I'm so tired all of a sudden?

24:37.200 --> 24:38.320
Wanwan,

24:38.840 --> 24:40.360
I naturally believe in you,

24:41.640 --> 24:44.040
but I can't stake
the entire Mirage Palace and the Humans

24:44.120 --> 24:45.200
on this gamble.

25:09.120 --> 25:11.120
Wanwan, fortunately, it wasn't you.

25:12.160 --> 25:13.280
You should sleep well.

25:13.960 --> 25:16.880
When you wake up,
everything will return to normal.

25:58.840 --> 25:59.920
We found it!

26:09.080 --> 26:10.120
Let's go!

26:14.440 --> 26:16.920
Yan Si, you must immediately
take the token back to the Master.

26:17.000 --> 26:18.720
-What about you?
-I still have a mission.

26:18.800 --> 26:20.520
I must stay hidden here
and cannot expose myself.

26:20.600 --> 26:22.680
Later, I'll pretend to return
from outside the city.

26:22.760 --> 26:23.720
They won't suspect me.

26:24.800 --> 26:26.640
-Hurry and leave.
-Be careful.

26:28.680 --> 26:29.920
Who are you?

26:32.640 --> 26:33.960
How dare you steal the token
from the Mirage Palace?

26:58.800 --> 26:59.760
The Spirit Clan?

27:02.280 --> 27:03.320
Madam.

27:06.760 --> 27:07.640
Seal off the entire city.

27:07.720 --> 27:09.280
No one is allowed out.

27:10.080 --> 27:11.640
Lock down the entire city
and search for the Spirit Clan.

27:11.720 --> 27:13.440
Guard all the pharmacies.

27:13.520 --> 27:15.160
All fire-type medicines
are forbidden for sale!

27:15.240 --> 27:16.480
Yes, madam!

27:32.200 --> 27:33.240
Have you found anything?

27:33.320 --> 27:34.160
-No.
-No.

27:34.240 --> 27:35.360
Keep searching.

27:35.440 --> 27:36.440
Understood.

27:48.680 --> 27:50.040
Are you Cui Wanwan from the Mirage Palace?

27:53.680 --> 27:55.760
Miss, don't be afraid.
We were entrusted by Miss Gao

27:55.840 --> 27:56.720
to come assist you.

27:56.800 --> 27:58.200
I see you've injured your arm.

27:58.280 --> 27:59.760
This place isn't far from the Mirage City.

27:59.840 --> 28:01.320
Let me escort you
back to the city for treatment.

28:02.800 --> 28:03.880
Thank you.

28:17.520 --> 28:18.560
Yan Si,

28:19.880 --> 28:21.160
the plan has begun.

28:22.360 --> 28:23.560
The great task will succeed.

28:27.080 --> 28:28.880
I won't let you die in vain.

28:32.040 --> 28:35.440
MIRAGE PALACE

28:35.520 --> 28:36.600
Young Madam,

28:37.360 --> 28:38.200
Mr. Xie has arrived.

28:45.440 --> 28:46.920
Why are you here?

28:47.000 --> 28:48.160
You're not here for that leaf, are you?

28:48.760 --> 28:49.960
I've already searched thoroughly.

28:50.040 --> 28:51.040
Nothing here.

28:52.040 --> 28:54.760
I've also searched the room
where Wanwan stayed.

28:54.840 --> 28:56.800
No token. Please stop suspecting her.

28:58.280 --> 28:59.160
We came here this time

29:00.080 --> 29:01.400
to visit Madam Su.

29:02.120 --> 29:04.360
Hey, you don't have any evidence.
Don't make false accusations at my madam.

29:04.440 --> 29:07.160
She's just too suspicious.
Don't harm Wanwan.

29:08.000 --> 29:09.160
Miss Gao, you're overthinking.

29:09.920 --> 29:11.480
We've already exposed our whereabouts

29:11.560 --> 29:12.720
while capturing the Serpent Spirit.

29:13.400 --> 29:15.440
It's impossible
to keep investigating secretly.

29:15.520 --> 29:16.360
So,

29:16.440 --> 29:17.800
there's no need for us to hide anymore.

29:17.880 --> 29:19.760
Xuyue and I have been in the city
for a while now.

29:20.360 --> 29:21.360
As juniors,

29:22.120 --> 29:23.800
we should visit Madam Su.

29:26.840 --> 29:28.480
What about your sharp-tongued cousin?

29:28.560 --> 29:30.240
And that female guard?

29:31.240 --> 29:32.960
They're at the inn, guarding the array.

29:33.040 --> 29:34.000
Guarding the array? What array?

29:35.120 --> 29:36.960
Though the Serpent Spirit
has already taken her own life,

29:37.040 --> 29:38.280
Feng Yao gained her spiritual essence.

29:39.040 --> 29:40.760
I've been thinking deeply.

29:40.840 --> 29:43.040
Suddenly, I remembered
an array recorded in ancient texts

29:43.120 --> 29:44.240
called the Rewinding Array.

29:44.320 --> 29:46.080
It can be activated within four hours.

29:46.160 --> 29:48.320
When it's ready, we'll place
the spiritual essence into the array,

29:48.400 --> 29:50.440
so that we can access
the Serpent Spirit's memories.

29:50.520 --> 29:53.440
We will quickly discover
who the mole in the Mirage Palace is,

29:53.520 --> 29:55.320
who's behind her,

29:55.400 --> 29:56.400
and what their plan is.

29:56.480 --> 29:58.400
We'll know everything clearly.

30:01.080 --> 30:02.800
Miss Gao, you seem a bit upset.

30:03.400 --> 30:05.040
Are you worried the array won't work,

30:05.600 --> 30:06.480
or are you afraid

30:06.560 --> 30:08.080
we might really find out the person?

30:10.720 --> 30:13.040
Whoever we find, we'll deal with them.
There will be no mercy.

30:15.600 --> 30:18.320
CELESTIAL INN

30:30.800 --> 30:32.000
Come out.

30:40.400 --> 30:43.160
Since you're here, why hide your face?

30:43.240 --> 30:45.080
Why not be honest

30:45.160 --> 30:46.920
and show your true face?

30:50.440 --> 30:53.160
Even if you destroy this array,
it won't matter.

30:53.240 --> 30:55.400
As long as we have
the Serpent Spirit's essence,

30:55.480 --> 30:58.200
we can restart the second, third… array.

30:58.280 --> 30:59.600
Don't waste your efforts.

31:19.640 --> 31:20.640
Look at you.

31:20.720 --> 31:22.600
You're just watching
the show from the outside,

31:22.680 --> 31:23.640
not helping at all,

31:23.720 --> 31:24.640
huh?

31:25.760 --> 31:27.400
The trap was set
right in the spiritual essence.

31:27.480 --> 31:29.480
Naturally, we needed her to get it first.

31:39.400 --> 31:40.240
Why is it you?

31:41.720 --> 31:43.360
-Why?
-I told you,

31:44.280 --> 31:46.040
everyone has something they desire.

31:47.560 --> 31:48.880
What do you want?

31:49.920 --> 31:51.200
I told you before

31:51.960 --> 31:53.680
about my background.

31:55.200 --> 31:56.560
But that wasn't true.

31:57.960 --> 31:59.240
Do you want to hear the real story?

32:01.240 --> 32:02.520
When I was very young,

32:03.200 --> 32:04.360
my biological parents

32:04.440 --> 32:07.840
sold me to human traffickers
who make disabled beggars.

32:09.080 --> 32:10.920
Do you know what they were involved in?

32:11.520 --> 32:13.080
Do you know how cruel it is?

32:14.280 --> 32:15.880
You don't know,

32:16.520 --> 32:18.760
but my biological parents did.

32:21.640 --> 32:23.560
But they still sold me

32:24.080 --> 32:25.400
just for a few coins.

32:26.280 --> 32:27.880
Then they went on to gamble.

32:28.600 --> 32:30.680
They were already deeply in debt.

32:30.760 --> 32:32.800
Why didn't they stop being greedy,

32:33.320 --> 32:37.000
still hoping to turn things around,
and become rich?

32:38.160 --> 32:39.480
But luckily,

32:39.560 --> 32:41.920
two monkey spirits passing by saved me,

32:43.160 --> 32:45.480
took me back to their settlement,

32:46.480 --> 32:47.800
and raised me.

32:50.640 --> 32:52.040
They were kind to me,

32:53.720 --> 32:55.920
and I regarded them as my real family.

33:01.400 --> 33:02.640
But one day,

33:05.520 --> 33:07.840
several injured human cultivators

33:11.760 --> 33:13.000
passed by there.

33:14.240 --> 33:15.680
The monkey spirits are pure-hearted,

33:16.320 --> 33:17.840
so they took them in

33:18.800 --> 33:21.120
and worked hard to find spiritual herbs

33:21.200 --> 33:22.800
to heal their wounds.

33:28.520 --> 33:30.360
But that night,

33:35.240 --> 33:36.680
they set up a Spirit Slaying array

33:38.160 --> 33:41.080
and killed all the monkey spirits

33:42.280 --> 33:45.760
just to take
their spiritual essence for a reward.

33:48.200 --> 33:51.160
Senior, you've lived a privileged life.

33:51.240 --> 33:53.680
Everyone has pampered and catered to you.

33:53.760 --> 33:55.560
Have you ever seen true human nature?

33:55.640 --> 33:58.880
Do you know how vile it can be
and how easily it can be tested?

34:03.760 --> 34:06.080
The real demon isn't in the Dark Abyss.

34:09.120 --> 34:10.159
It's here, in the human world.

34:12.159 --> 34:15.320
Since this world hasn't given
the Spirit Clan a way to live,

34:17.360 --> 34:20.639
then I'll find a new way for them.

34:22.639 --> 34:24.480
Does your new way

34:25.760 --> 34:27.639
mean cooperating with the Dark Abyss

34:27.719 --> 34:29.280
and letting them destroy the Humans?

34:29.360 --> 34:30.199
What's wrong with that?

34:30.280 --> 34:31.400
But you're human too!

34:31.480 --> 34:33.239
If I could, I wouldn't want to be human!

34:40.080 --> 34:41.880
You knew all along
that we've already suspected you.

34:42.840 --> 34:44.000
With such an obvious trap,

34:44.080 --> 34:46.520
why would you still jump into it?

34:48.360 --> 34:49.639
You should understand.

34:50.239 --> 34:51.760
Just like you want to believe me,

34:51.840 --> 34:55.040
but you don't dare bet the Mirage Palace
and the Humans on it,

34:55.120 --> 34:56.679
I'm the same.

34:56.760 --> 34:59.240
I also have something
more important than my life to protect.

35:00.240 --> 35:01.680
Yan Si can die.

35:01.760 --> 35:03.040
I can die too.

35:04.120 --> 35:06.160
But our plan cannot be exposed.

35:06.240 --> 35:07.920
Our great task must proceed.

35:09.720 --> 35:10.880
Luckily,

35:10.960 --> 35:12.240
this is just a trap.

35:15.560 --> 35:17.280
Who is the master
of the Decaying Immortal Pavilion,

35:18.360 --> 35:20.080
who can make you so devoted?

35:23.440 --> 35:24.440
It seems

35:25.080 --> 35:26.760
she doesn't plan to confess.

35:28.400 --> 35:30.560
Wanwan, even though you deceived me,

35:30.640 --> 35:33.080
there's one thing that's true.
All these years,

35:34.040 --> 35:36.120
among all the sisters
of the Mirage Palace,

35:38.320 --> 35:40.720
you've always stayed by my side.

35:41.760 --> 35:44.840
I don't want you to be harmed.
I don't want you to die.

35:44.920 --> 35:46.840
As long as you hand over the token

35:46.920 --> 35:48.040
and tell me who's behind it,

35:48.120 --> 35:50.240
I'll go beg the Madam to spare your life.

35:50.320 --> 35:51.160
Is that okay?

35:58.720 --> 36:00.160
At this point,

36:02.040 --> 36:03.800
you're still willing to trust me?

36:03.880 --> 36:05.560
Of course, I'm willing to trust you.

36:05.640 --> 36:07.040
Turn back.

36:07.120 --> 36:08.960
If… If you want to save the Spirit Clan,

36:09.040 --> 36:10.080
you can discuss it with me.

36:10.160 --> 36:11.960
We'll figure out a way together. Okay?

36:14.080 --> 36:15.320
Alright.

36:15.400 --> 36:16.440
Alright.

36:17.200 --> 36:18.600
I'll give you the token.

36:30.240 --> 36:31.240
Don't come closer!

36:34.640 --> 36:35.560
Senior,

36:36.240 --> 36:37.760
you're still too naive.

36:37.840 --> 36:39.400
-Cui Wanwan, you're insane!
-Move!

36:48.040 --> 36:50.000
Gao Qiumin, you really are a fool.

36:50.920 --> 36:53.280
All these years, you thought
everyone's respect for you

36:53.360 --> 36:54.920
was because they liked you
or respected you?

36:55.600 --> 36:57.080
It's just because of your identity.

36:57.680 --> 36:59.200
I'm no different from them.

36:59.720 --> 37:00.680
I hate you too.

37:01.360 --> 37:02.880
And that Su Ningzhen,

37:02.960 --> 37:04.040
she controls you at every turn.

37:04.120 --> 37:05.720
You don't even know how to resist.

37:05.800 --> 37:07.840
Someone like you,
still thinking of helping me?

37:08.400 --> 37:09.240
You're not just naive,

37:09.320 --> 37:11.120
-you're foolish.
-Have you said enough?

37:11.720 --> 37:12.800
Yes, I've said enough.

37:13.920 --> 37:15.320
Let's go our separate ways from now on.

37:27.880 --> 37:28.720
Wanwan!

37:41.520 --> 37:43.240
Just being a regular cultivator,

37:43.320 --> 37:44.600
living an ordinary life,

37:44.680 --> 37:46.760
always staying by your side,

37:46.840 --> 37:47.720
watching you

37:47.800 --> 37:50.000
become the greatest
female cultivator of the Humans,

37:50.080 --> 37:53.440
and watching you stand atop the Humans!

38:07.640 --> 38:09.320
She deserves to die.

38:10.640 --> 38:11.680
Search her.

38:15.200 --> 38:16.200
It's alright.

38:17.240 --> 38:18.280
What you're afraid to do,

38:18.880 --> 38:20.680
I will do for you.

38:36.160 --> 38:37.120
What's wrong?

38:37.640 --> 38:38.720
It seems

38:39.440 --> 38:40.760
everything is going too smoothly.

38:41.720 --> 38:43.040
Isn't smoothness a good thing?

38:49.360 --> 38:50.600
Mr. Xie,

38:52.840 --> 38:54.880
thank you all for your help this time.

38:54.960 --> 38:57.040
We will remember this kindness.

38:57.640 --> 38:58.640
Madam, you're too polite.

38:59.840 --> 39:01.440
I sincerely invite you all to be
our guests at the Mirage Palace tonight,

39:01.520 --> 39:03.200
so I can show my hospitality.

39:04.040 --> 39:06.320
Mr. Xie, please don't refuse.

39:07.880 --> 39:10.880
Since Madam invited,
we will certainly attend the banquet.

39:12.120 --> 39:13.400
That's great.

39:14.480 --> 39:16.400
I'll go back to the palace
and make arrangements.

39:25.320 --> 39:27.280
Are you sure you're members
of the Immortal Alliance?

39:28.000 --> 39:29.520
Su Ningzhen looks

39:30.120 --> 39:31.680
even colder than Sang Qi.

39:33.040 --> 39:34.320
Don't speak carelessly.

39:38.920 --> 39:40.720
Why do you look so upset?

39:41.440 --> 39:43.080
Is it because of Cui Wanwan's words?

39:45.480 --> 39:47.520
I thought you only stood with the Humans.

39:48.120 --> 39:50.120
I didn't expect you
to sympathize with the Spirit Clan.

39:51.480 --> 39:53.200
Then, why did you

39:53.280 --> 39:55.760
stop me from killing Gao Qiumin?

39:59.400 --> 40:00.600
I judge based on right and wrong.

40:00.680 --> 40:01.920
It has nothing to do with Clans.

40:03.080 --> 40:04.680
Gao Qiumin's wrongdoings
didn't deserve death.

40:04.760 --> 40:06.680
If you wanted to kill her,
I naturally had to stop you.

40:10.600 --> 40:13.880
So, that means,
if I had more right reasoning,

40:13.960 --> 40:15.560
-you would also side with me?
-Except you.

40:17.280 --> 40:18.560
Why?

40:19.280 --> 40:20.440
Your reasoning

40:21.200 --> 40:22.120
is mostly nonsense.

40:24.200 --> 40:26.120
What's wrong with nonsense?

40:26.200 --> 40:27.520
Nonsense is still reasoning.

40:28.640 --> 40:31.160
MIRAGE PALACE

40:33.400 --> 40:35.800
This time, we've eliminated the mole
and retrieved the token

40:35.880 --> 40:36.800
thanks to your help.

40:37.440 --> 40:38.640
I'll toast you all.

40:40.840 --> 40:41.880
I don't drink wine.

40:42.640 --> 40:43.480
Then, let's substitute with tea.

40:44.640 --> 40:45.480
That's fine.

40:46.520 --> 40:47.560
Please.

40:51.120 --> 40:51.960
Please.

40:58.200 --> 40:59.760
Mr. Xie,

40:59.840 --> 41:01.120
you were trapped in the Dark Abyss.

41:01.200 --> 41:03.880
We were slow to respond
and failed to rescue you in time.

41:04.480 --> 41:06.240
Instead, you came to help while injured.

41:06.320 --> 41:07.160
I truly feel ashamed.

41:08.120 --> 41:09.520
You're being too hard on yourself.

41:10.880 --> 41:13.760
But Mr. Xie and Mr. Nan,

41:14.480 --> 41:17.160
since you came to my place this afternoon,
why didn't you tell me beforehand?

41:18.600 --> 41:20.200
The so-called "Rewinding Array"

41:20.880 --> 41:22.640
was just your trick of luring the enemy.

41:24.080 --> 41:26.280
Could it be you two

41:26.880 --> 41:28.280
don't trust me?

41:29.920 --> 41:30.760
How could that be?

41:31.480 --> 41:33.160
It's just that there are
many people in the Mirage Palace.

41:33.760 --> 41:36.680
If we're luring the enemy,
it's better if fewer people know.

41:37.280 --> 41:40.360
Speaking of which,
we only informed Miss Gao

41:40.440 --> 41:41.760
after we set the trap.

41:43.720 --> 41:44.880
Madam,

41:45.400 --> 41:47.320
I don't think
all the Spirit Clan members are--

41:47.400 --> 41:48.280
Enough.

41:48.800 --> 41:51.280
Let's not talk about unpleasant things
at this banquet.

41:53.000 --> 41:54.320
We have homemade wine.

41:55.280 --> 41:56.800
It's made with rare spiritual flowers.

41:57.600 --> 42:00.440
Except for Mr. Xie,
the rest of you should try it.

42:00.520 --> 42:02.440
I've already sent someone to get it.
It'll be here soon.

42:04.600 --> 42:05.640
Please.

42:12.280 --> 42:13.120
What are you doing here?

42:23.960 --> 42:25.120
Zai Xi?

42:25.800 --> 42:27.240
Why is it her bringing the wine?

42:45.080 --> 42:46.360
The Soul-Stealing Gu?

42:46.440 --> 42:47.680
Xie Xuechen!

42:47.760 --> 42:48.800
Elder Zai Xi!

42:48.880 --> 42:50.040
Don't touch her! It spreads easily.

42:53.840 --> 42:55.240
It's the legendary Dark Abyss Gu curse.

42:55.960 --> 42:57.320
Why would it be here?

42:58.960 --> 42:59.880
The Dark Abyss Gu curse?

43:04.240 --> 43:05.280
Madam…
